                                "sense_id": "263cf321-fcfb-3a8c-8b67-e70e916ab3a7",
                                "text": "Swinging onto the Treherbert branch under the new OLE, the train's onboard Passenger Information Screens announce we have entered a 'no alcohol' zone. That doesn't seem to help, as some of the passengers who joined us earlier seem 'well oiled' already."
